- ✅ `[GeneratedRegex]` used for 3 static patterns with `#if NET7_0_OR_GREATER` fallback — `L13-33`
- ✅ `IsAllUpperCase` uses `foreach` loop instead of LINQ `.All()` — `L159-165`
